WEBVTT

01:30.400 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:50.160 --> 01:51.000
Are you still awake?

02:00.680 --> 02:04.560
Have you been staying up
because you are worried about me?

02:11.160 --> 02:13.080
Don't flatter yourself.

02:13.600 --> 02:15.000
We are enemies.

02:15.080 --> 02:18.880
If it weren't for String Bonding,
I'd gotten rid of you long ago.

02:18.960 --> 02:20.000
Don't worry.

02:20.920 --> 02:21.840
It's not that easy for me to die.

02:26.600 --> 02:27.960
That's one more reason for me to worry.

02:30.080 --> 02:32.160
I hope that the Lotus of Life dies

02:32.680 --> 02:34.400
from the explosion
caused by Feng Xiang today.

02:35.400 --> 02:36.240
You can give up

02:37.280 --> 02:38.920
and I can stop wasting my time with you.

02:44.520 --> 02:48.560
I will try again no matter what.

02:50.400 --> 02:51.840
I hope the Lotus of Life is fine

02:52.640 --> 02:55.000
and we will see the day
that we get lotus seeds.

02:56.680 --> 02:57.800
I will be back.

03:00.320 --> 03:01.520
What if…

03:03.040 --> 03:04.000
What if you can't get back?

03:08.600 --> 03:09.920
In that case,

03:11.520 --> 03:13.080
the String Bonding
will disappear on its own.

03:13.680 --> 03:16.920
If that happens,
you can get back by yourself.

03:20.880 --> 03:22.720
Why didn't you start with that?

03:23.360 --> 03:25.040
I don't want to hear anything else.

03:43.720 --> 03:46.240
I think that since Feng Xiang is dead now,

03:46.320 --> 03:48.200
the danger in the woods
must have disappeared with her.

03:50.560 --> 03:52.880
Even if there are still any,
I've been here yesterday.

03:52.960 --> 03:53.960
I'll be fine.

03:55.600 --> 03:56.480
Mu Xuanling.

03:57.680 --> 04:00.240
If we are in danger, don't mind me.

04:02.080 --> 04:03.360
You are telling me that?

04:11.240 --> 04:12.360
The Lotus of Life is no common plant.

04:13.120 --> 04:14.120
It's not damaged at all.

04:15.320 --> 04:18.720
Even the plants around it
are recovering fast.

04:26.840 --> 04:28.440
The Lotus of Life.

04:49.400 --> 04:50.600
The Lotus of Life!

04:52.000 --> 04:53.720
It does exist.

04:53.800 --> 04:55.080
Feng Xiang?

04:58.520 --> 04:59.960
Saint.

05:00.640 --> 05:02.040
You are all right?

05:04.520 --> 05:05.360
Who are you?

05:07.080 --> 05:08.960
We met yesterday.

05:09.560 --> 05:10.520
Don't you remember?

05:11.240 --> 05:12.080
My memory is not so bad

05:12.160 --> 05:13.400
that I can't remember
things happened yesterday.

05:14.040 --> 05:15.840
The Lotus of Life. Life.

05:15.920 --> 05:17.760
Who are you? Who sent you?

05:17.840 --> 05:18.800
What are you doing here?

05:18.880 --> 05:22.000
Did Feng Xiang come back to life
because of the Lotus of Life?

05:22.520 --> 05:25.440
Saint, we got into this place by accident.

05:26.120 --> 05:27.440
I wonder what that is?

05:27.520 --> 05:28.360
You mentioned

05:29.200 --> 05:30.080
that it's the Lotus of Life.

05:30.760 --> 05:33.000
Absorbing the aura of the world

05:33.600 --> 05:35.280
and forming the Waterless Land,

05:35.360 --> 05:38.040
nothing can do that
other than the Lotus of Life.

05:38.120 --> 05:40.480
Can people gain immortality
by taking the Lotus of Life?

05:40.560 --> 05:42.600
Can they recover even if they suffered

05:43.440 --> 05:45.120
-an unrecoverable injury?
-Of course.

05:45.200 --> 05:48.000
The Lotus of Life
can give people immortality,

05:48.080 --> 05:49.600
let alone physical injuries.

05:52.400 --> 05:54.440
You are already
in the spiritual form stage.

05:54.520 --> 05:56.360
You will live much longer
than common people.

05:56.880 --> 05:58.240
Why are you after immortality?

05:59.040 --> 06:03.000
Immortality
is the goal of all cultivators.

06:03.520 --> 06:04.880
With enough time,

06:04.960 --> 06:07.680
one might break through the spiritual form

06:08.320 --> 06:09.760
and ascend to a higher stage.

06:10.480 --> 06:11.840
Besides,

06:14.080 --> 06:15.200
I don't have much time left.

06:25.680 --> 06:27.120
According to the records
in the Immortal Alliance,

06:27.640 --> 06:29.360
when the Dark Clan
invaded the human realm,

06:29.440 --> 06:31.200
the Dark Abyss kept pushing its boundary
toward the human world.

06:31.840 --> 06:33.720
The top cultivator, Qian Guang,

06:33.800 --> 06:35.800
mustered the power of all immortal sects
and formed the Immortal Alliance.

06:35.880 --> 06:38.960
They paid a great price
to form the Immortals Array,

06:39.600 --> 06:41.240
which stopped
the invasion of the Dark Clan.

06:43.000 --> 06:44.760
You are not aged.

06:45.400 --> 06:46.760
You should still have
hundreds of years to live.

06:46.840 --> 06:48.720
Is your lifespan shortened

06:49.440 --> 06:50.760
because of some severe injury?

06:52.920 --> 06:54.240
That's correct.

06:55.000 --> 06:56.600
But it has nothing to do with you.

06:57.360 --> 06:59.680
I don't know how you wandered
into this place,

07:00.440 --> 07:02.240
but you don't belong here.

07:02.760 --> 07:03.760
Please leave.

07:05.080 --> 07:06.960
This is a place
with sufficient spiritual power.

07:07.040 --> 07:09.640
We want to train here.

07:10.720 --> 07:12.560
Find someplace far away.

07:13.960 --> 07:16.280
I don't like seeing strange people.

07:25.440 --> 07:29.320
Are you suspecting that Feng Xiang
revived after died yesterday,

07:29.400 --> 07:33.680
plus she has lived for 6,000 years
because she ate the Lotus of Life?

07:36.240 --> 07:39.760
But why doesn't she remember anything
that happened yesterday?

07:40.280 --> 07:41.400
I don't understand that either.

07:41.920 --> 07:45.520
Maybe there is something strange
about the Lotus of Life.

07:46.480 --> 07:48.360
When I saw her yesterday,

07:49.320 --> 07:51.600
it was as if she saw the Lotus of Life
for the first time.

07:52.120 --> 07:53.520
I even speculated

07:54.160 --> 07:57.560
that she had an accident
that caused her lifespan to shorten.

07:58.560 --> 08:00.560
She knew that she didn't
have much time left,

08:01.080 --> 08:03.760
so she relied on the Lotus of Life
to live longer.

08:04.960 --> 08:06.640
She probably has guarded this place

08:07.480 --> 08:09.320
for the last 6,000 years.

08:10.520 --> 08:15.000
That means she has attained immortality,

08:15.520 --> 08:16.480
yet she doesn't know it at all.

08:17.640 --> 08:20.280
She thought she needed to wait
for the Lotus of Life to bloom.

08:20.360 --> 08:21.840
In that case,

08:22.600 --> 08:25.240
she might have tried to get
the Lotus of Life multiple times.

08:27.040 --> 08:29.840
If she has kept any of the lotus seeds,
which are useless to her,

08:31.240 --> 08:33.919
then we wouldn't have to wait
for the lotus to bloom

08:34.000 --> 08:35.440
or fear that we don't have enough time.

08:36.240 --> 08:37.480
What do you plan to do?

08:37.559 --> 08:38.880
Let's keep waiting

08:39.480 --> 08:41.720
and see all the things
that are abnormal about her.

08:54.480 --> 08:55.760
She's still there.

09:11.480 --> 09:13.760
She… She disappeared!
Feng Xiang has disappeared!

09:25.520 --> 09:27.720
How did she disappear into thin air?

09:28.320 --> 09:31.280
The Dark Cloud Mountain
just keeps surprising us with strangeness.

09:32.280 --> 09:33.800
The sun is going down.

09:33.880 --> 09:37.520
If Feng Xiang is still around,
the spirit fog will move with her.

09:37.600 --> 09:39.160
It seems that she's no longer here.

09:40.080 --> 09:41.320
But she couldn't be far away,

09:42.280 --> 09:44.360
so that she could get here
first thing tomorrow morning

09:45.000 --> 09:46.280
to get the Lotus of Life.

09:46.360 --> 09:49.520
To figure this out,
we need to find her first.

09:50.320 --> 09:53.320
Maybe we can find some lotus seeds
at her resting place for the night.

09:54.800 --> 09:56.200
I'll go search for Feng Xiang's aura.

09:56.720 --> 09:57.880
You wait for me in the cave we stayed.

09:59.480 --> 10:00.600
Why?

10:01.160 --> 10:03.480
I've been following
you around for a whole day

10:03.560 --> 10:06.720
and you are ditching me
when we are so close to the truth.

10:07.560 --> 10:09.160
My eyesight is not worse than yours.

10:09.240 --> 10:11.280
I'm not afraid after nightfall.

10:11.360 --> 10:13.320
-I'm just worried about you.
-What for?

10:13.960 --> 10:17.200
Now that we've traveled so long,
I have to know.

10:17.280 --> 10:18.680
Don't even try to exclude me.

10:20.600 --> 10:21.600
Fine.

10:22.760 --> 10:23.600
Let's go check things out together.

11:14.720 --> 11:16.080
What is she doing here?

11:17.200 --> 11:18.480
Let's get closer.

11:30.360 --> 11:32.160
Is she dead?

11:33.200 --> 11:34.640
She's just feeble.

11:35.360 --> 11:36.320
She'll wake up when the sun is up.

11:37.120 --> 11:40.760
Isn't it dangerous for her
to be defenseless like this?

11:40.840 --> 11:44.400
Even if she dies, she'll revive tomorrow.

11:44.480 --> 11:45.480
Right?

11:48.120 --> 11:51.240
If there are lotus seeds left,
where could they be?

12:17.000 --> 12:18.240
He…

12:18.320 --> 12:20.000
Is he a human or a ghost?

12:24.880 --> 12:25.760
Qian Guang!

12:34.440 --> 12:36.400
Yes. I am Qian Guang.

12:36.480 --> 12:37.320
QIAN GUANG

12:37.400 --> 12:38.720
How did you recognize me?

12:38.800 --> 12:39.640
According to historical records,

12:39.720 --> 12:42.680
Qian Guang was the first leader
who founded the Immortal Alliance.

12:42.760 --> 12:44.920
He and Feng Xiang are companions.

12:45.440 --> 12:48.480
They fought evils together
and were nightmares for the Dark Clan.

12:49.000 --> 12:50.640
Yet, the two top
spiritual form cultivators

12:50.720 --> 12:52.720
disappeared after setting
the Immortals Array

12:52.800 --> 12:54.480
and were never seen again.

12:54.560 --> 12:55.520
The legend has it

12:55.600 --> 12:58.840
that Qian Guang and Feng Xiang
are in love and formed a bond.

12:58.920 --> 12:59.960
They were in seclusion.

13:00.640 --> 13:03.040
No one has seen these two saints again.

13:03.800 --> 13:07.040
When I saw Feng Xiang,
I wondered about you.

13:07.680 --> 13:10.200
Who would have thought
that my guess was right?

13:13.440 --> 13:14.280
It has been 6,000 years.

13:16.680 --> 13:19.560
If you didn't barge in here,
I'd have forgotten the time.

13:21.600 --> 13:24.000
Sir, how did you and Feng Xiang

13:24.080 --> 13:25.960
get trapped in the Dark Cloud Mountain
for 6,000 years?

13:27.600 --> 13:31.200
Besides, it seems that Feng Xiang
is in a cycle.

13:31.280 --> 13:33.120
Is it because of the Lotus of Life?

13:36.240 --> 13:37.280
You have accurate intuition.

13:37.360 --> 13:38.840
You are close to the truth.

13:39.880 --> 13:42.200
Every day when the sun comes out,

13:42.280 --> 13:43.880
Feng Xiang would wake up here.

13:44.560 --> 13:46.320
And when the sun goes down,

13:46.400 --> 13:47.960
she would lose
all her consciousness and memories

13:48.040 --> 13:49.280
and get back here.

13:49.360 --> 13:51.800
Then she'd begin
another repeated day here.

13:51.880 --> 13:54.640
So, she lived for 6,000 years,

13:55.480 --> 13:58.640
yet it's just one repeated day for her.

13:59.880 --> 14:02.000
Is this the immortality
brought by the Lotus of Life?

14:03.280 --> 14:06.040
People dream about immortality.
They go to extremes for that.

14:06.120 --> 14:08.120
But how can there be no cost?

14:13.000 --> 14:15.800
Feng Xiang and I
encountered an evil cultivator

14:15.880 --> 14:17.640
who tried to steal the Chaos Pearl.

14:17.720 --> 14:19.480
He seemed young and decent,

14:19.560 --> 14:21.440
yet he claimed that he learned

14:21.520 --> 14:23.320
an evil method
that absorbs the souls of others

14:23.400 --> 14:26.000
to get immortality.

14:26.680 --> 14:28.720
I can't believe
that someone would cultivate

14:28.800 --> 14:30.480
that kind of evil method
for the Chaos Pearl.

14:30.560 --> 14:32.480
To achieve immortality
with the Lotus of Life

14:32.560 --> 14:34.760
also requires a great sacrifice.

14:36.160 --> 14:38.400
When Feng Xiang ate the Lotus of Life,

14:38.920 --> 14:40.320
she didn't get immortality.

14:40.400 --> 14:43.920
She entered a Realm of Power Inhibition.

14:46.320 --> 14:50.800
There's nothing but a lofty ladder
in that realm.

14:51.920 --> 14:54.120
The cultivators' spiritual channels
will be sealed off,

14:54.200 --> 14:55.840
and have to take

14:55.920 --> 14:59.000
the 38,000 attacks
from the blade-like wind

14:59.080 --> 15:00.640
and get to the end of the lofty ladder.

15:01.840 --> 15:04.280
Cultivators who haven't reached
the spiritual form stage

15:04.360 --> 15:07.640
will be shredded into dust
by a mere touch of the wind.

15:08.160 --> 15:09.280
Those who are in the spiritual form stage

15:09.880 --> 15:11.840
still have to suffer
from the pain of slow-slicing

15:12.760 --> 15:16.200
to end up meeting
the High Cyclic Divinity.

15:17.000 --> 15:18.560
The High Cyclic Divinity?

15:18.640 --> 15:21.560
He claims to be
the deity of time in the divine realm

15:21.640 --> 15:23.120
and has been guarding
the realm for 10,000 years.

15:23.200 --> 15:24.880
He said that he was waiting for someone.

15:25.400 --> 15:28.040
Maybe a human, or maybe not.

15:28.120 --> 15:31.040
There are…
still Divine Clan members in the world.

15:32.280 --> 15:36.080
I heard of a legend that 10,000 years ago,

15:36.160 --> 15:37.760
the Divine Clan
protected all living beings

15:37.840 --> 15:39.600
and was worshiped by them.

15:39.680 --> 15:41.000
Yet, a human emperor, Zhao Ming,

15:41.080 --> 15:43.520
misguided the inner demons of human beings
and attacked the Divine Clan.

15:43.600 --> 15:45.360
The Divine Clan put him down

15:45.440 --> 15:46.480
and he was reduced to a degenerated deity.

15:47.080 --> 15:50.720
He was kept under the Lava,
and thus the Dark Clan was born.

15:50.800 --> 15:53.000
The Divine Clan found
human beings repellent because of that

15:53.080 --> 15:55.400
and stopped offering
protection to the world.

15:55.920 --> 15:56.840
So, how could there be

15:56.920 --> 15:59.360
a Divine Clan member
who's still guarding the world?

16:01.440 --> 16:04.360
When I saw him,
he was filled with divine power.

16:04.440 --> 16:07.120
If he's not a Divine Clan member,
who could he be?

16:07.200 --> 16:10.360
He told me
that Feng Xiang ate the Lotus of Life

16:10.440 --> 16:12.200
and bore the pain of countless slices

16:12.280 --> 16:13.800
to meet him.

16:14.640 --> 16:17.920
The High Cyclic Divinity
claimed that he was a kind deity.

16:18.600 --> 16:19.960
Whoever meets him…

16:20.760 --> 16:25.000
Whoever meets me can make a wish.

16:25.520 --> 16:27.760
I will make the wish come true.

16:27.840 --> 16:29.520
But you have to know

16:29.600 --> 16:31.720
that fate has its way.

16:31.800 --> 16:34.000
If you are wishing for too much,

16:34.080 --> 16:35.640
fate will make you pay.

16:36.600 --> 16:38.440
That's the cost of wishes.

16:38.960 --> 16:42.640
The more you wish for,
the greater the cost.

16:43.160 --> 16:44.240
Do you understand?

16:45.000 --> 16:46.240
Yes.

16:48.320 --> 16:49.560
I wish

16:52.360 --> 16:54.120
for immortality

16:56.400 --> 16:58.200
and forever youth.

16:59.400 --> 17:01.320
Once your wish is granted,

17:01.400 --> 17:05.599
it can never be revoked,
no matter what happens.

17:06.760 --> 17:09.400
The same with the cost.

17:10.480 --> 17:11.640
Do you understand?

17:13.200 --> 17:15.880
Yes. Yes.

17:17.920 --> 17:22.359
Since then, Feng Xiang has been stuck
on the same day forever.

17:22.960 --> 17:25.680
The realm of the High Cyclic Divinity
only opens once for an individual.

17:26.280 --> 17:29.520
It doesn't matter how many Lotuses of Life
she eats after that.

17:30.480 --> 17:33.080
Immortality
is where the Divine Clan's power lies.

17:33.680 --> 17:35.360
It's not for human beings to get.

17:35.960 --> 17:38.760
Immortality in that form is a punishment.

17:39.280 --> 17:41.640
That is the cost that Feng Xiang paid.

17:41.720 --> 17:44.200
But you have also existed for 6,000 years.

17:44.280 --> 17:47.320
So, did you make a wish
to the High Cyclic Divinity as well?

17:49.840 --> 17:52.480
You are brilliant. Yes.

17:53.400 --> 17:54.640
In the second year that she left,

17:54.720 --> 17:58.240
I searched the world
and finally found her here.

17:58.320 --> 17:59.640
She was already in the cycle.

17:59.720 --> 18:02.880
I tried to take her away,
but once the sun went gown,

18:02.960 --> 18:04.640
she would be brought back here.

18:06.920 --> 18:09.280
I kept her company for a hundred years.

18:09.360 --> 18:10.520
That was over 36,000 days and nights.

18:11.640 --> 18:13.920
But whenever she woke up,
her memories reset,

18:14.000 --> 18:15.760
and she forgot
what happened the day before.

18:17.240 --> 18:19.120
Humans have a short lifespan.

18:19.200 --> 18:21.160
I was out of time,

18:21.240 --> 18:23.480
and I didn't want to leave
her alone in this world.

18:24.120 --> 18:25.080
So,

18:26.240 --> 18:30.400
I took the Lotus of Life
when it was mature again.

18:30.920 --> 18:34.080
Eventually,
I met the High Cyclic Divinity.

18:40.920 --> 18:43.840
A hundred years ago, she also came here

18:45.040 --> 18:46.880
and wished for immortality.

18:47.400 --> 18:48.600
I gave her that.

18:49.480 --> 18:52.840
But she's stuck in the same day forever.

18:52.920 --> 18:55.520
Isn't that also immortality?

18:56.280 --> 18:57.800
She got what she wished for.

18:58.960 --> 19:02.240
So, what is your wish?

19:05.760 --> 19:08.960
Can I wish for her to get rid
of immortality like that?

19:09.040 --> 19:11.160
Wishes granted cannot be changed.

19:11.680 --> 19:14.960
Otherwise,
I'd be breaking my promise to her.

19:15.480 --> 19:17.560
Can you restore her memories?

19:18.320 --> 19:19.960
That would be the jurisdiction
of the High Fate Divinity.

19:20.880 --> 19:24.160
He never gives back what he took away.

19:24.240 --> 19:27.160
You should focus on a wish for yourself.

19:27.920 --> 19:31.280
I'm not quite patient.

19:34.640 --> 19:38.440
I wish I could live and die with her

19:39.200 --> 19:40.560
and never be apart.

19:42.720 --> 19:43.920
Granted.

19:54.080 --> 19:54.960
Feng Xiang.

20:15.680 --> 20:16.720
Feng Xiang.

20:31.800 --> 20:32.840
Since then,

20:33.920 --> 20:35.600
I have become her shadow.

20:36.840 --> 20:38.320
I'm always close by,

20:39.920 --> 20:41.440
yet she never knows.

20:43.200 --> 20:45.800
Are you and Feng Xiang a couple?

20:46.600 --> 20:47.600
I owe her.

20:49.600 --> 20:52.440
Back then, the Dark Clan
overrun the human world,

20:53.040 --> 20:55.840
and I traveled around
to found the Immortal Alliance.

20:56.360 --> 20:58.520
I heard of Feng Xiang often.

20:59.200 --> 21:00.520
They said that she made
a name for herself at a young age

21:00.600 --> 21:01.440
and that she's outstanding.

21:01.520 --> 21:03.480
The Strike of Phoenix she developed

21:04.160 --> 21:05.640
is a horror to the Dark Clan.

21:07.000 --> 21:09.640
There were a lot of saints

21:10.240 --> 21:12.640
who expressed their love
openly or secretly,

21:12.720 --> 21:16.280
hoping to become
a couple in cultivation with her.

21:17.000 --> 21:19.760
Yet Feng Xiang
was famously cruel and detached.

21:20.560 --> 21:21.680
Cultivation was the only thing
she cared about.

21:22.520 --> 21:25.320
Romance
was the most annoying thing for her.

21:27.360 --> 21:31.280
Having a no-good partner
will only delay my cultivation progress.

21:32.480 --> 21:34.080
Men are always a drag.

21:39.880 --> 21:41.320
You are different from them.

21:42.120 --> 21:43.560
You are foolish,

21:44.080 --> 21:45.320
yet you have more talents than me.

21:46.000 --> 21:47.760
If you focus on your cultivation,

21:47.840 --> 21:50.880
you might break through
the spiritual form one day

21:50.960 --> 21:52.880
and achieve immortality.

21:53.960 --> 21:57.240
Yet you are wasting your time
in fighting evils.

21:58.480 --> 21:59.720
When bothered by all the trivial things,

22:00.320 --> 22:02.680
you get distracted from your cultivation.

22:02.760 --> 22:04.360
That slowed down your progress.

22:06.360 --> 22:09.520
Your goal in cultivation
is to explore the limits of humanity.

22:09.600 --> 22:12.560
My goal is to maintain peace on this land.

22:13.560 --> 22:15.840
Immortality is not what I'm after.

22:15.920 --> 22:18.200
I want to do as many things beneficial

22:18.280 --> 22:20.640
to humanity as possible
in a limited lifespan.

22:21.600 --> 22:24.880
So, what's your answer?

22:25.400 --> 22:28.920
Will you join the Immortal Alliance
and fight the Dark Clan with us?

22:30.560 --> 22:32.080
Why would I?

22:33.000 --> 22:34.560
I'm not attached
to the mundane world in any way.

22:35.520 --> 22:39.360
Cultivation is the only thing I'm after.

22:39.440 --> 22:41.080
Have you ever thought about

22:41.600 --> 22:45.480
why you haven't broken through
the spiritual form stage

22:45.560 --> 22:46.560
after a hundred years of cultivation?

22:47.960 --> 22:49.040
Do you know the reason?

22:49.560 --> 22:50.680
If you don't know
the mundane world enough,

22:50.760 --> 22:52.440
how can you break through
the spiritual form stage?

22:52.520 --> 22:53.560
If you don't do things
that matter at the moment,

22:53.640 --> 22:55.760
how can you achieve immortality?

22:58.800 --> 23:00.120
You

23:01.480 --> 23:02.680
are interesting in some ways.

23:03.920 --> 23:06.160
So, are you agreeing?

23:15.040 --> 23:16.320
Come on.

23:16.400 --> 23:19.400
I'll follow you to get to know
the mundane world

23:19.920 --> 23:21.280
and deal with what matters at the moment.

23:25.720 --> 23:28.120
You and Feng Xiang are always together.

23:28.200 --> 23:30.400
Are you a couple now?

23:32.200 --> 23:35.600
Saint Feng Xiang is divine-like.

23:35.680 --> 23:37.080
How can I offend her?

23:39.000 --> 23:41.680
Since you don't have a partner,
what do you think of my sister?

23:43.520 --> 23:46.640
Thank you for your kindness.

23:46.720 --> 23:50.200
I already have someone on my mind.

23:50.720 --> 23:54.320
By that, did you mean Saint Feng Xiang?

23:55.600 --> 23:57.640
-Yes.
-Have you told her?

24:02.800 --> 24:03.760
No.

24:04.760 --> 24:05.760
During the time we were together,

24:05.840 --> 24:09.160
she never expressed any interest
in a romantic relationship with me.

24:09.960 --> 24:10.960
I thought

24:12.280 --> 24:14.160
she didn't see me that way.

24:15.240 --> 24:16.160
After that,

24:16.720 --> 24:20.120
I got busier
with affairs in the Immortal Alliance.

24:20.640 --> 24:24.080
Feng Xiang showed up less and less.

24:24.680 --> 24:28.200
Someone else told me
that she was in seclusion in the East Sea.

24:28.880 --> 24:32.720
She didn't even tell me
that she was leaving.

24:38.440 --> 24:39.320
Feng Xiang!

24:45.200 --> 24:47.600
How's your life on the Osprey Island?

24:47.680 --> 24:50.240
Thank you for showing your care,
Leader Qian Guang.

24:50.760 --> 24:51.840
I'm fine.

24:57.280 --> 24:58.840
Since you love Feng Xiang so much,

24:59.360 --> 25:01.440
why didn't you tell her?

25:01.520 --> 25:04.120
Is it because you were angry?

25:04.200 --> 25:06.000
I've never been angry with her.

25:11.640 --> 25:12.880
I didn't say anything

25:14.160 --> 25:15.520
because I thought I'd die.

25:17.400 --> 25:18.840
When forming the Immortals Array,

25:19.840 --> 25:21.320
ten saints shall each take a star position

25:21.400 --> 25:22.960
and face the power of retribution

25:23.040 --> 25:24.480
of the array with the help
of the Chaos Pearl.

25:24.560 --> 25:26.160
That's how the array can be connected.

25:27.400 --> 25:30.080
In the ten star positions,
one of them is the death position.

25:31.120 --> 25:34.400
The one who takes that position
will take a lethal strike.

25:35.120 --> 25:36.760
I kept that position to myself.

25:38.560 --> 25:39.800
I thought

25:39.880 --> 25:43.040
about telling her my feelings
before I die.

25:43.880 --> 25:45.160
Maybe she'd laugh at me

25:46.440 --> 25:49.200
or feel annoyed.

25:50.320 --> 25:51.280
Or maybe

25:52.160 --> 25:54.520
she also feels something for me.

25:55.600 --> 25:57.360
But what then?

25:57.440 --> 25:59.360
I had no chance to survive.

25:59.440 --> 26:01.240
Why bring her bad feelings?

26:02.920 --> 26:04.720
The Immortals Array was a success.

26:05.240 --> 26:06.480
The Dark Clan was sealed.

26:06.560 --> 26:08.120
Peace was returned to the human world,

26:08.640 --> 26:10.520
and I was lucky enough to survive the hit.

26:11.040 --> 26:12.360
I passed out for days,

26:13.800 --> 26:15.440
and when I woke up, I learned that…

26:16.400 --> 26:18.080
Saint Feng Xiang was severely injured

26:18.160 --> 26:19.160
and is in seclusion on Osprey Island.

26:19.960 --> 26:20.840
What?

26:21.520 --> 26:22.800
With Feng Xiang's power,

26:24.320 --> 26:25.280
she shouldn't be severely injured.

26:25.880 --> 26:28.480
Half of the saints in the other positions
are dead.

26:28.560 --> 26:30.640
Let alone the death position.

26:31.320 --> 26:34.040
Even with Saint Feng Xiang's power,
the Thunder Trial Fire is still too much.

26:34.120 --> 26:35.600
That's the karma used to slay deities.

26:36.200 --> 26:39.680
It was me who was in the death position.

26:40.200 --> 26:41.200
Saint Feng Xiang

26:42.840 --> 26:43.680
asked for the death position for herself.

26:45.000 --> 26:47.080
She switched the array diagram
and asked me to keep that from you.

26:47.680 --> 26:49.000
She said that she was
more powerful than you.

26:49.080 --> 26:51.120
She'd be able to survive
the death position

26:51.200 --> 26:53.480
and complete the Immortals Array.

26:54.240 --> 26:55.320
I'm going to her now.

26:55.840 --> 26:56.720
Leader Qian Guang.

26:57.320 --> 26:58.680
Saint Feng Xiang never got back.

26:58.760 --> 27:01.440
-Where could she be?
-We don't know.

27:02.400 --> 27:04.280
Her heart was never on the Osprey Island.

27:04.360 --> 27:06.320
If she wants to leave, we can't stop her.

27:08.120 --> 27:11.600
So, where did she put her heart?

27:14.120 --> 27:16.240
Since you have no affection for Saint,

27:16.320 --> 27:17.920
why act so sentimental here?

27:18.720 --> 27:21.760
She risked her life to complete the array
and never wanted anything in return.

27:21.840 --> 27:22.840
If you care about her,

27:22.920 --> 27:24.920
how can you not know
her affection for you?

27:25.000 --> 27:26.800
She's such a proud and respected person.

27:26.880 --> 27:28.120
If it weren't for her feelings for you,

27:28.200 --> 27:30.120
why would she stay
by your side the whole time?

27:30.200 --> 27:33.120
The world sees you as a benevolent person
who takes the world on his shoulders.

27:33.200 --> 27:34.880
Who knows that she…

27:35.400 --> 27:36.320
For you,

27:36.400 --> 27:38.880
she wasted her time
and delayed her cultivation.

27:38.960 --> 27:40.360
Why do you think she did that?

27:40.440 --> 27:41.480
Why?

27:42.200 --> 27:44.160
I've never thought about that.

27:45.080 --> 27:46.840
Maybe I just didn't have the courage.

27:46.920 --> 27:48.440
How could I not love Feng Xiang?

27:49.120 --> 27:52.320
But Feng Xiang said
that I was different from the others.

27:52.400 --> 27:54.280
I didn't admire her or fastened onto her.

27:54.360 --> 27:55.720
That's why she was willing
to hang out with me.

27:55.800 --> 27:59.000
If I told her about my feelings,

28:00.600 --> 28:03.440
I would have been no different
from the others.

28:05.000 --> 28:06.680
I was afraid that I'd lose her.

28:07.720 --> 28:10.240
Saint Feng Xiang is divine-like.

28:10.320 --> 28:12.160
How can I offend her?

28:12.240 --> 28:13.720
Since you don't have a partner,

28:13.800 --> 28:15.520
what do you think of my sister?

28:17.560 --> 28:20.320
Thank you for your kindness.

28:20.840 --> 28:24.120
I already have someone on my mind.

28:25.760 --> 28:27.640
She heard my lie,

28:29.040 --> 28:31.800
and I never had the chance
to tell her my feelings.

28:32.480 --> 28:33.880
I have no chance to do that.

28:36.440 --> 28:37.480
This is how the world works.

28:38.080 --> 28:39.240
You don't always get

28:40.880 --> 28:41.760
a second chance.

28:42.360 --> 28:43.440
Qian Guang.

28:44.240 --> 28:45.560
You've been guarding
Feng Xiang for 6,000 years

28:45.640 --> 28:46.760
and never left her side.

28:46.840 --> 28:50.200
I believe that you value
human connections.

28:51.320 --> 28:53.160
If you know where the lotus seeds
that were produced are,

28:53.240 --> 28:54.080
please tell me,

28:54.680 --> 28:56.560
so that I can detoxify
the Disillusion Water

28:56.640 --> 28:57.960
and save someone's life.

29:03.080 --> 29:06.880
People drink the Disillusion Water
to forget about sentiments.

29:06.960 --> 29:08.600
Since she had a realization,

29:09.440 --> 29:10.560
why force it?

29:10.640 --> 29:11.720
If she did have a realization,

29:12.240 --> 29:13.800
she doesn't need assistance
to control her mind

29:13.880 --> 29:15.240
and force herself to forget.

29:17.560 --> 29:20.080
She was forced to become detached,
and it's conflicting with her faith,

29:20.160 --> 29:22.280
hurting her both inside and outside.
That's why she's in danger.

29:25.880 --> 29:26.840
Xie Xuechen.

29:27.520 --> 29:29.240
Who are you talking about?

29:29.960 --> 29:33.000
What is the Disillusion Water?

29:36.440 --> 29:38.280
She and I were enemies.

29:38.960 --> 29:40.840
We met by accident
and got to know each other.

29:40.920 --> 29:42.040
She risked everything to help me,

29:42.760 --> 29:43.800
and I haven't gotten a chance

29:43.880 --> 29:44.720
-to repay her.
-The things

29:44.800 --> 29:45.920
-that Xie Xuechen is talking about…
-She was set up by a treacherous man,

29:46.000 --> 29:47.560
-are so familiar somehow.
-forced to take the Disillusion Water.

29:47.640 --> 29:48.760
Now her life is in danger.

29:48.840 --> 29:49.960
Is it because…

29:50.040 --> 29:51.880
I'm worried that she can't wait
for the lotus to bloom.

29:51.960 --> 29:53.840
When the lotus seeds fall, she'd be…

29:53.920 --> 29:55.000
Xuanling!

29:56.240 --> 29:58.880
-Xuanling!
-You want the seeds of the Lotus of Life

29:58.960 --> 30:00.120
for me.

30:01.320 --> 30:03.920
Qian Guang. If it was her choice,

30:04.000 --> 30:06.600
I could let go
as long as she could be free.

30:06.680 --> 30:08.440
But you can see how she is.

30:09.240 --> 30:12.360
The more she's suffering,
the more she's not willing to forget.

30:12.440 --> 30:13.840
If we don't cure her,

30:13.920 --> 30:15.800
the Disillusion Water
will be lethal to her.

30:15.880 --> 30:17.800
If you can tell me where the seeds are,

30:17.880 --> 30:18.920
I would be in debt to you.

30:19.520 --> 30:20.600
I will pay you back,

30:20.680 --> 30:22.760
wherever, whenever, and however.

30:28.920 --> 30:29.840
No need to feel that you owe me.

30:30.800 --> 30:33.760
Feng Xiang got all the Lotuses of Life
that bloomed over the years.

30:34.360 --> 30:35.520
She just doesn't remember.

30:36.280 --> 30:39.760
I buried all the lotus seeds
that Feng Xiang left behind here.

30:56.120 --> 30:56.960
Thank you, Qian Guang.

30:57.640 --> 31:01.000
The seeds of the Lotus of Life
are also known as Worldly Bitterness.

31:01.760 --> 31:04.160
The Disillusion Grass is a poison,
and the lotus seed is the medicine.

31:04.240 --> 31:07.080
People think that becoming detached

31:07.160 --> 31:09.640
and having their feelings cleared
is the realization.

31:10.720 --> 31:12.480
But the true realization

31:12.560 --> 31:15.760
is still being benevolent
and loving the world

31:15.840 --> 31:17.360
after tasting
all the bitterness of the world

31:17.440 --> 31:18.840
and feeling all the sorrows.

31:19.360 --> 31:22.600
That is disillusion.

31:25.520 --> 31:27.000
Being benevolent

31:28.160 --> 31:29.800
after tasting
all the bitterness of the world.

31:30.320 --> 31:31.760
That's the true disillusion.

31:34.480 --> 31:36.480
You can have the lotus seed.

31:37.000 --> 31:39.360
Leave this place and never come back.

31:40.600 --> 31:41.680
Thank you.

31:50.280 --> 31:51.360
Each lotus seed

31:52.320 --> 31:54.120
represents a hundred years.

31:55.120 --> 31:56.280
Qian Guang.

31:56.360 --> 31:57.880
Is there anything we can do for you?

32:00.040 --> 32:03.080
This is the power of divinities.
No one can change it.

32:03.600 --> 32:06.680
I'm grateful for your kindness.

32:06.760 --> 32:08.960
Have you tried to communicate
with the High Fate Divinity?

32:09.040 --> 32:11.200
Maybe he can lift the curse.

32:13.240 --> 32:14.080
Curse?

32:15.400 --> 32:16.360
Right.

32:16.440 --> 32:17.960
This wish is no different from a curse.

32:19.080 --> 32:21.160
I thought about finding
the High Fate Divinity.

32:21.920 --> 32:25.360
But there's only the High Cyclic Divinity
in the vast divine realm.

32:26.080 --> 32:27.520
There were no other divinities.

32:30.600 --> 32:34.160
The High Cyclic Divinity is strange.

32:35.000 --> 32:37.040
He's not as kind as he claims.

32:37.880 --> 32:38.920
Maybe

32:40.520 --> 32:41.400
he was lying.

32:44.080 --> 32:45.560
He did say

32:46.120 --> 32:48.600
that someone was lying.

32:50.280 --> 32:51.120
Who is it?

32:56.040 --> 32:57.080
He said…

32:57.160 --> 32:58.600
HIGH CYCLIC DIVINITY

32:58.680 --> 33:02.320
This world is just a lie.

33:11.080 --> 33:12.080
The sun is about to come up.

33:13.240 --> 33:17.680
I wish I could enjoy the sunrise with her.

34:24.639 --> 34:26.360
Take the lotus seed.

34:28.000 --> 34:31.600
What if I'm not recovered after taking it?

34:32.400 --> 34:33.840
What if I still don't like you?

34:35.080 --> 34:36.239
This time,

34:37.280 --> 34:39.159
I'm not letting you go no matter what.

34:44.880 --> 34:46.639
I'm curious

34:47.159 --> 34:50.080
how I feel about you.

35:14.880 --> 35:15.760
Mu Xuanling.

35:15.840 --> 35:17.200
Mu Xuanling!

35:17.280 --> 35:18.160
Mu Xuanling!

35:32.560 --> 35:33.560
I said

35:34.240 --> 35:35.800
that I would protect you no matter what.

35:36.480 --> 35:37.960
I will stay by your side.

36:00.120 --> 36:01.960
Enough! Xie Xuechen!

36:02.040 --> 36:03.240
Do not get closer!

36:07.400 --> 36:08.520
Mu Xuanling!

36:09.040 --> 36:10.040
Mu Xuanling!

36:18.320 --> 36:20.520
I don't have romantic feelings for Mister,

36:21.960 --> 36:23.240
but for you, I do.

36:24.320 --> 36:25.560
So, you are able to avoid me.

36:26.680 --> 36:29.400
Are you willing to take me with you?

36:29.480 --> 36:30.640
SWIRLING SNOW PAVILION

36:30.720 --> 36:33.640
You can live a normal life here.

36:35.000 --> 36:36.920
This is Snow City.

36:37.000 --> 36:38.560
It's my decision.

36:42.920 --> 36:44.600
I don't want to go back to the Dark Abyss.

36:45.200 --> 36:46.720
I want to live under the sun.

36:47.240 --> 36:50.600
When we have a chance,
I'll show you the real human world.

36:52.160 --> 36:53.280
Mu Xuanling.

36:56.080 --> 36:57.080
Wait for me.

36:59.320 --> 37:00.320
Mu Xuanling.

37:00.960 --> 37:01.960
Mu Xuanling.

37:03.160 --> 37:04.160
Mu Xuanling.

37:05.360 --> 37:06.360
Mu Xuanling.

37:12.720 --> 37:13.640
Xie Xuechen.

37:16.080 --> 37:17.080
Xuanling!

37:18.520 --> 37:19.840
You remember now!

37:29.440 --> 37:30.480
Xie Xuechen.

37:32.920 --> 37:34.120
I'm sorry.

37:34.200 --> 37:35.200
I'm sorry.

37:35.720 --> 37:37.520
I hurt you so many times.

37:39.080 --> 37:41.360
You must have hurt every time.

37:41.440 --> 37:42.960
I remember everything now.

37:45.360 --> 37:46.360
They didn't hurt.

37:47.320 --> 37:48.680
Not at all.

37:49.760 --> 37:51.520
I deserved all those.

37:52.400 --> 37:55.200
Think of them as my punishments.

37:56.120 --> 37:57.120
No.

37:57.760 --> 37:58.880
Not punishments.

37:59.960 --> 38:01.040
They are…

38:02.600 --> 38:03.800
What?

38:17.120 --> 38:18.120
Xie Xuechen.

38:20.040 --> 38:21.680
Thank you for bringing me back.

38:48.600 --> 38:49.680
Mu Xuanling.

38:52.480 --> 38:54.120
Thank you for coming back.

38:56.760 --> 38:57.800
Thank you.

39:19.120 --> 39:19.960
Guys.

39:22.680 --> 39:24.160
Any reason that you are here?

39:30.440 --> 39:32.560
We got into
the Phoenix Perch Forest by accident.

39:33.080 --> 39:33.960
We are leaving.

39:34.040 --> 39:35.280
Saint,

39:35.360 --> 39:37.880
I know that you are searching
for the Lotus of Life.

39:37.960 --> 39:41.200
But it will be some time
for the Lotus of Life to mature.

39:41.720 --> 39:43.400
You could go to the cave

39:43.480 --> 39:44.720
in the southeast
of the Phoenix Perch Forest.

39:45.320 --> 39:49.240
I heard that the cave is extremely dark
and no light can get in,

39:49.320 --> 39:51.960
but there are rare plants
that can prolong one's life.

39:52.600 --> 39:56.160
You don't have to bring light to discover

39:56.240 --> 39:58.480
things that deserve your attention
more than the Lotus of Life.

40:21.160 --> 40:24.560
She still went to the Waterless Land
to guard the Lotus of Life.

40:25.160 --> 40:27.800
Is there no chance to break the curse
of the High Cyclic Divinity?

40:30.800 --> 40:31.800
I know.

40:32.840 --> 40:34.120
You are thinking that the cave is dark

40:34.200 --> 40:37.040
and Qian Guang might be able
to show his physical form.

40:37.120 --> 40:38.280
Even so,

40:38.360 --> 40:40.600
it's just one day of happiness for them.

40:40.680 --> 40:41.520
Right?

40:44.400 --> 40:46.240
For Qian Guang,

40:46.320 --> 40:48.320
this one day

40:48.400 --> 40:52.000
allows them to live happily
and show their affection to each other.

40:53.040 --> 40:55.720
That triumphs many days
in the past and the future.

40:56.360 --> 40:57.960
Detachment doesn't mean freedom.

40:58.480 --> 41:00.080
Sentiments don't mean pain.

41:02.040 --> 41:03.280
For those who have loved,

41:03.800 --> 41:07.360
even miserable death
can't change their hearts.

41:08.600 --> 41:09.960
It's the same for Feng Xiang,

41:11.120 --> 41:12.640
for Qian Guang,

41:14.920 --> 41:17.640
and for us.

41:22.240 --> 41:23.320
Where are we going now?

41:25.480 --> 41:27.080
Where can you go?

41:27.680 --> 41:29.640
Snow City guards the Chaos Pearl,

41:30.240 --> 41:31.600
and I will guard you.

41:32.280 --> 41:33.440
No matter what you think about that,

41:33.960 --> 41:35.320
you have to come back
to Snow City with me.

41:36.840 --> 41:39.960
I don't know if I should call you
unreasonable or scoundrel.

41:41.440 --> 41:42.600
Call me whatever you want,

41:43.800 --> 41:45.320
but you are not getting away.

41:51.320 --> 41:52.640
Xie Xuechen.

41:53.160 --> 41:55.680
Your String Bonding is still effective.

41:56.360 --> 41:57.840
Why are you holding me so tight?

41:58.360 --> 42:00.280
Are you worried that I might get away?

42:00.800 --> 42:04.000
Does holding one's hand
mean keeping someone from getting away?

42:04.520 --> 42:07.680
Don't you know that String Bonding
is the bonding of marriage?

42:10.480 --> 42:11.360
Miss Mu.

42:26.000 --> 42:29.200
You don't care about
the Immortal Alliance or humanity.

42:29.280 --> 42:30.840
You are helping Xie Xuechen

42:30.920 --> 42:33.880
because you want to see
what interesting things you can find

42:33.960 --> 42:35.520
in this boring world.

42:35.600 --> 42:39.680
What you really care about is me.

42:40.200 --> 42:41.200
Am I right?

42:42.320 --> 42:43.720
What are you doing here?

42:45.680 --> 42:47.600
It seems that you've found the lotus seed.

42:48.120 --> 42:49.520
It took some effort,

42:50.560 --> 42:51.880
but we found it.

42:53.400 --> 42:55.440
Xuanling has returned
to her normal status.

42:56.040 --> 42:57.640
She remembers everything now.

42:59.040 --> 43:01.640
Shouldn't you be waiting
in Greenview Heights for our news?

43:02.280 --> 43:03.560
What brought you here?

43:06.400 --> 43:09.120
I sensed the alert
from the jade I gave Miss Mu.

43:09.840 --> 43:11.680
It seems that some sort of attack

43:11.760 --> 43:13.840
triggered the array on it.

43:14.360 --> 43:15.280
I was worried
that something might have happened,

43:15.920 --> 43:17.280
so I rushed here.

43:17.800 --> 43:18.960
Alert from the jade?

43:21.880 --> 43:24.680
But I didn't sense that alert.

43:26.480 --> 43:29.120
Maybe I have triggered
the array by accident.

43:29.200 --> 43:30.640
It might be me.

43:37.480 --> 43:39.640
Let's not waste our time here.

43:39.720 --> 43:40.880
Let's talk outside.

43:48.960 --> 43:51.760
Sir, she seems to be avoiding you.
